  <body>
    <div class="container" id="switch">
      <h2><a href="./index.html">Go в примери</a>: Превключване (Switch)</h2>
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Изявленията от вида <em>switch</em> (превключване) изразяват
условия с множество разклонения.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code empty leading">
            
          
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            <a href="https://go.dev/play/p/fOR6FObkkxT"><img title="Run code" src="play.png" class="run" /></a><img title="Copy code" src="clipboard.png" class="copy" />
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;time&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Ето просто изявление <code>switch</code>.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">i</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Пишем &#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">i</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34; като &#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">switch</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">i</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;едно&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;две&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;три&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Може да ползвате запетаи, за да разделите множество
изрази в едно изявление в един случай – <code>case</code>.
В този пример ползваме и незадължителния случай
<code>default</code> (когато не попаднем в нито един от
изброените преди това случаи).</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">switch</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Now</span><span class="p">().</span><span class="nf">Weekday</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">Saturday</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">Sunday</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Почивен ден е.&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">default</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Работен ден е.&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p><code>switch</code> без израз  е друг начин да извършваме
логически действия както при if/else. Тук също
показваме, че изразите <code>case</code> може и да не са
непроменливи (константи).</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Now</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">switch</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Hour</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">&lt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">12</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Преди обяд е.&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">default</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;След обяд е.&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p><code>switch</code> (превключване) между <em>видове</em> сравнява
видовете на променливите вместо техните стойности.
Можете да ползвате този подход, за да откриете вида
за взаимодействие с дадена стойност<sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:ival"><a href="#fn:ival">1</a></sup>. В този
пример променливата <code>t</code> ще има вид, съответстващ на
вида на нейния случай.</p>

<div class="footnotes">

<hr />

<ol>
<li id="fn:ival">interface value – стойност на вида взаимодействие</li>
</ol>

</div>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">каквоСъмАз</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">func</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">i</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">any</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">switch</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">i</span><span class="p">.(</span><span class="kd">type</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">bool</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Аз съм булева стойност – %T.\n&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Аз съм цяло число – %T.\n&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">default</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Printf</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Непознат тип – %T\n&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">t</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">каквоСъмАз</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">каквоСъмАз</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">каквоСъмАз</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Ей!&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="gp">$</span> go run switch.go 
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">Пишем 2 като две
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">Работен ден е.
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">След обяд е.
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">Аз съм булева стойност – bool.
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">Аз съм цяло число – int.
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">Непознат тип – string</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
      
